docs {
  # AcademicService.CreateSections

  Sections of a period

  `/ltedu.academic.v1.AcademicService/CreateSections` · unary · `ltedu/academic/v1/academic.proto`

  ## Request — `CreateSectionsRequest`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `institution_slug` | `string` |  |
  | `period_id` | `string` |  |
  | `level_id` | `string` |  |
  | `grade_ids` | `repeated string` | One section per grade × name (CEPRE: no grades) |
  | `names` | `repeated string` |  |
  | `shift` | `string` |  |
  | `attention_mode` | `string` |  |
  | `capacity` | `int32` |  |
  | `room` | `string` |  |
