  | `tutor_name` | `string` |  |
  | `program` | `string` | EBA only: pebaja \| literacy, and virtual \| itinerant when attention_mode is distance |
  | `distance_variant` | `string` |  |
  | `multigrade` | `bool` | EBA only: gathers students of several grades of the cycle; grade_id is the lowest |

